# Unknown commands are explained, ignored, and never make the shell unresponsive.
@phase 1.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< frobnicate payload
> info string unknown command "frobnicate" ignored
< isready
> readyok
< debug on
! silence 50ms
< mystery
> info string debug received "mystery"
> info string unknown command "mystery" ignored
< debug off
> info string debug received "debug off"
< isready extra
> info string invalid isready: unexpected argument
< isready
> readyok
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# Oversized input is drained as one rejection and cannot prefix the next command.
@phase 1.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
! send-oversized-line
> info string invalid input: line exceeds 65536 bytes
< isready
> readyok
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
